{
    "title": "Dreameow Tiles: Piano & Music",
    "description": "<b><h2>Tap Piano Tiles, Tap The Beat, Listen your favorite music!</h2></b> \r\nLooking for a piano tile game to challenge your finger speed? \ud83c\udfb6\r\n\r\nDreameow Tiles is designed for music lovers. The game includes songs from the world's leaderboards, songs you are listening. K-Pop, EDM, Classical\u2026 All genres you are looking for. \r\n\r\nPlay your favorite songs with tones of tile skins, Tape and capture the rhythm. Dreameow Tiles will transport you to a world of fun and excitement.\r\n\r\n<b><h2>Light, Relaxing design</h2></b>\r\n\ud83c\udfb9 At home, on the sofa. At School on the break. Everywhere you like, simply open your game and pick a song to start. Enjoy the beat on your break time. Listen the songs you love and feel the fun.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude0d<b>CUTENESS OVERLOAD</b>\r\nCute songs with cute styles, you can choose the one that suits your mood best.Whether you're into classical, pop, or rock music, you'll find a piano style and theme that's perfect for you.\r\n\r\nRule of the game :\r\n1. Tap, hold, and swipe the tiles\r\n2. Don`t miss the tiles\r\n3. Endless mode: Expect to speed up each rounds\r\n\r\nGame features:\r\n1. Tones of song: Appealing, modern, and diverse music genres to satisfy your taste! We have free songs waiting for you to conquer.\r\n2. Battle mode: Connect with  players worldwide. You can also invite your friends to play!\r\n3. Unique theme design: Beside what we offered, you can upload your own picture!\r\n\r\nSo what are you waiting for? One of the most exciting beats and tile piano games of 2023 is awaiting you.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b><h2>Tap Piano Tiles, Tap The Beat, Listen your favorite music!</h2></b> <br>Looking for a piano tile game to challenge your finger speed? \ud83c\udfb6<br><br>Dreameow Tiles is designed for music lovers. The game includes songs from the world&#39;s leaderboards, songs you are listening. K-Pop, EDM, Classical\u2026 All genres you are looking for. <br><br>Play your favorite songs with tones of tile skins, Tape and capture the rhythm. Dreameow Tiles will transport you to a world of fun and excitement.<br><br><b><h2>Light, Relaxing design</h2></b><br>\ud83c\udfb9 At home, on the sofa. At School on the break. Everywhere you like, simply open your game and pick a song to start. Enjoy the beat on your break time. Listen the songs you love and feel the fun.<br><br>\ud83d\ude0d<b>CUTENESS OVERLOAD</b><br>Cute songs with cute styles, you can choose the one that suits your mood best.Whether you&#39;re into classical, pop, or rock music, you&#39;ll find a piano style and theme that&#39;s perfect for you.<br><br>Rule of the game :<br>1. Tap, hold, and swipe the tiles<br>2. Don`t miss the tiles<br>3. Endless mode: Expect to speed up each rounds<br><br>Game features:<br>1. Tones of song: Appealing, modern, and diverse music genres to satisfy your taste! We have free songs waiting for you to conquer.<br>2. Battle mode: Connect with  players worldwide. You can also invite your friends to play!<br>3. Unique theme design: Beside what we offered, you can upload your own picture!<br><br>So what are you waiting for? One of the most exciting beats and tile piano games of 2023 is awaiting you.",
